gatewayHelpText="The app opens through the fnOS unified gateway inside NAS Web and needs no port exposed to the outside."
portLabel="Listen port"
portHelpText="Listen port for DSH Web. An iframe entry needs a fixed port, so 0 is not allowed."
portRequiredMessage="Enter a listen port"
portPatternMessage="Enter a port between 1 and 65535"
trustedHostsLabel="Trusted access address"
trustedHostsHelpText="Enter the host or host:port from the address bar you use to open NAS Web, for example 192.0.2.10:5666. If you are unsure about the port, enter just the host; separate several addresses with commas. Do not include http:// or https://, and do not append a path (a trailing /); wrap IPv6 addresses in brackets, for example [fd00::1]:5666. Do not enter 3080, which is DSH's own port."
trustedHostsRequiredMessage="Enter the host or host:port of NAS Web"
trustedHostsPatternMessage="Only a host or host:port is allowed (several separated by commas): no http:// or https://, no path, port 1-65535 without leading zeros"
